From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Virtroid build <build@virtroid.invalid>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:17:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] keep hardened_malloc in programs started with privileges

DISABLE_HARDENED_MALLOC switches a process to Scudo. A program run with
AT_SECURE (file capabilities or a setuid bit) must not take that choice
from whoever started it, so the variable joins the others cleared for
such programs.
---
 libc/bionic/libc_init_common.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/libc/bionic/libc_init_common.cpp b/libc/bionic/libc_init_common.cpp
index 7df0b01f1..c889572b4 100644
--- a/libc/bionic/libc_init_common.cpp
+++ b/libc/bionic/libc_init_common.cpp
@@ -303,6 +303,7 @@ static bool __is_unsafe_environment_variable(const char* name) {
   // security transition.
   static constexpr const char* UNSAFE_VARIABLE_NAMES[] = {
       "ANDROID_DNS_MODE",
+      "DISABLE_HARDENED_MALLOC",
       "GCONV_PATH",
       "GETCONF_DIR",
       "HOSTALIASES",
